url: "https://adammatthewsteinberger.github.io/clippy-pet/"
abstract: >-
  An unofficial, open-source animated paperclip pet for the ChatGPT desktop app
  and Codex CLI, implementing the v2 pet format: a JSON manifest and a
  1536x2288 WebP sprite atlas with nine animation states and sixteen look
  directions. The repository includes editable source frames, a contract
  validator, published QA evidence, and a reusable packaging and release
  pipeline with reproducible tarballs, cosign-signed checksums, and build
  provenance attestations. Not affiliated with Microsoft or OpenAI.
keywords:
